    <briefdescription>
<para>Streaming ZSTD decompressor. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Decompress a ZSTD-framed stream chunk by chunk.</para>
<para>Typical usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_zstd_stream_decompressor_1a330df2e45766cf7e7f5964d05d987a7d" kindref="member">ZstdStreamDecompressor</ref><sp/>dec;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">while</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(read_chunk(buf,<sp/>len))<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>out<sp/>=<sp/>dec.decompress_chunk(buf,<sp/>len);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(out)<sp/>process(*out);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(dec.is_done())<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">break</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
